#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SelectEncoding), group (GENERAL)
#. +> stable
#: kscd.kcfg:84
msgid "Allow encoding selection."
msgstr "Koderenköör verlöven."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_SelectEncoding)
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (SelectEncoding), group (GENERAL)
#. +> stable
#: configWidgetUI.ui:270 kscd.kcfg:85
msgid "When this option is selected, you have the ability to select encoding for the results of a CDDB request. The standard describes CDDB results as being strictly Latin1. This is not true, as non-English speaking users often use other 8-bit encodings."
msgstr "Wenn disse Optschoon anmaakt is, kannst Du de Koderen för de Resultaten vun en CDDB-Anfraag utsöken. Na den Standard mööt de CDDB-Resultaten streng \"Latin1\" wesen. Man redig bruukt nich-engelsche Brukers faken anner 8-Bit-Koderen."

